msgctxt "56_Miki"
msgid "I've got my confidence back, thanks to you."
msgstr "Gracias jefe, pude recuperar la confianza."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm happy to hear that."
msgstr "Me alegra oír eso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "80_Miki"
msgid "I think I'll send that Taniguchi a message."
msgstr "Creo que le escribiré a Taniguchi ahora mismo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "What, right now?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Ahora mismo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "104_Miki"
msgid "Uh-huh. I've got to get that newly hatched hunk away from\\r\nthat other hostess."
msgstr "Ajá. Tengo que alejar a ese galán recién nacido de las otras hostesses."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah. Well, I won't try to stop you..."
msgstr "Bueno... Tal vez deberías parar con eso..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "200_Taniguchi"
msgid "Miki! It's been so long!"
msgstr "¡Miki-chan! ¡Cuánto tiempo sin verte!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "212_Miki"
msgid "Didn't you get a huge makeover?"
msgstr "¿No te habías hecho un cambio de imagen? ¿Qué pasó con el tipo guapo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "224_Taniguchi"
msgid "You heard about that? I guess Akiyama-san must've told you,\\r\nhuh?"
msgstr "¿Cómo te enteraste de eso, Miki-chan...? Oh, así que Akiyama-san te lo contó."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "236_Miki"
msgid "Akiyama-san?"
msgstr "¿Akiyama-san?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "248_Akiyama"
msgid "No, no. Miki saw you walking around with your new look－and\\r\nanother hostess."
msgstr "¿Yo? Ja, ja, nooo. Lo que pasa es que Miki te vio caminando por ahí, muy guapo, con otra hostess."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "260_Taniguchi"
msgid "Oh, right... Well, I did have more girls coming after me\\r\nonce I changed my image, but we never lasted longer than\\r\na date or two."
msgstr "Ah, eso... Es cierto que había otras mujeres que iban detrás de mí cuando cambié mi imagen, pero me dejaban después de la primera o segunda cita."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "272_Taniguchi"
msgid "I felt like I wasn't myself, like I was living a lie... I\\r\nguess even the best makeover in the world is really only skin-deep."
msgstr "Sentía que no era yo mismo, como si estuviera viviendo una mentira... Supongo que al final no basta con solo transformarse por fuera."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "284_Taniguchi"
msgid "I eventually came to accept that this is the best style for\\r\nme after all."
msgstr "Me terminé dando cuenta, una vez más, de que este es el estilo que mejor me va."

